meta {
  name: Proxy IGDB Image
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/image-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.igdb.com%2Figdb%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Ft_cover_big%2Fco3ofx.jpg
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  url: https%3A%2F%2Fimages.igdb.com%2Figdb%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Ft_cover_big%2Fco3ofx.jpg
}

docs {
  Proxies an IGDB (or HowLongToBeat) cover image server-side, since both
  origins block direct hotlinking in some contexts. Only images.igdb.com
  and howlongtobeat.com URLs are allowed; anything else returns 400.

  Response is cached for 24h (Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400,
  immutable).
}
